 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;/tr&gt; 					&lt;tr&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 265.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 97%"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 81pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 97%"&gt; 								&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 85.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 97%"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;/tr&gt; 					&lt;tr&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 265.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 97%"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Net deferred tax liability &lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 81pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 97%"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;(6,091)&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 85.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 97%"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;(5,558)&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;/tr&gt; 				 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: 18pt; font-size: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Arial"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: 18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The valuation allowance at December 31, 2025 and 2024 is primarily the result of the uncertainty of realizing tax benefits associated with the Company's certain long-term medical and employee retirement benefits and the net operating loss carryforwards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;The Company has federal and state net operating loss (NOL) carryforwards of approximately $0.27 million and $1 million, respectively at December 31, 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;The federal NOL will carry forward indefinitely and the state NOL expires between 2042 and 2043.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: 18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;NOTE F - ASSET RETIREMENT OBLIGATION&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: 18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company accounts for its Asset Retirement Obligation (&amp;quot;ARO&amp;quot;) in accordance with FASB ASC 410, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Asset Retirement and Environmental Obligations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;. Under ASC 410, entities are required to record the fair value of a legal liability for an ARO in the period in which it is incurred. In determining the ARO, the Company considered the uncertainties of the fuel off load dates related to the DOE's timing of performance regarding its obligation to dispose of the spent nuclear fuel and high-level waste. The Company estimates the fair value of the ARO using present value techniques in which it makes various assumptions including estimates of the amounts and timing of future cash flows and credit adjusted risk free rates for changes in cash flows (for 2025, there were no changes made to the cash flow assumptions that were included in the Decommissioning Cost Estimate filed and accepted by FERC in 2024; 5.6% was used in 2024.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; The ARO is reported in the Balance Sheets. When the Company revises any of the assumptions used to calculate the fair value of the ARO, it adjusts the carrying amount of both the ARO liability and the related regulatory asset or liability.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: 18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: 18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The following table presents the details of the Company's ARO which are presented as Deferred Credits in the accompanying balance sheets:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left: 67.5pt; border-collapse: collapse"&gt; 				 					&lt;tr&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 175.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td colspan="2" style="width: 198pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;December 31,&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 58.5pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(Dollars in Thousands)&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;/tr&gt; 				 				 					&lt;tr&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 175.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 103.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 94.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;/tr&gt; 					&lt;tr&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 175.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;Beginning balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 33.3pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 103.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;165,093&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 94.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;131,430&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;/tr&gt; 					&lt;tr&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 175.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;Accretion&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 103.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;10,239&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 94.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;8,372&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;/tr&gt; 					&lt;tr&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 175.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;Settled&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 103.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;(10,540)&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 94.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(10,319)&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;/tr&gt; 					&lt;tr&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 175.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;Adjusted&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 103.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;(1,779)&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 94.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;35,610&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;/tr&gt; 					&lt;tr&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 175.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span&gt;Ending balance&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 103.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;163,013&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 						&lt;td style="width: 94.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 							&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 								&lt;span style="width: 18pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;165,093&lt;/span&gt; 							&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;/tr&gt; 				 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.65pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; As of January 1, 2003, the value of the plant balance which generated the ARO was fully depreciated. The incremental asset recorded as an offset to the ARO was fully depreciated as well since the plant asset had no remaining useful life. In accordance with ASC 980, the Company recorded no statement of operations impact for either the cumulative depreciation charged on the incremental asset or the reduction of liability recorded. &lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.65pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.65pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; The assets included in the Decommissioning Trust are restricted for settling the ARO and all other decommissioning obligations.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.65pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;NOTE G - DECOMMISSIONING&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Yankee Decommissioning Trust (Trust)&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: 18pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="width: 18pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;The Trust was established under the Indenture of Trust dated April 16, 1981 and last revised January 1, 2010. The purpose of the Trust is to provide segregated funds to pay for the cost of decommissioning the Plant, including the ISFSI. The Company has provided for decommissioning costs in accordance with FERC rate orders and NRC regulations.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;In November 1985, the Trust Indenture was revised to reflect Section 468A of the Internal Revenue Code (&amp;quot;IRC&amp;quot;). In conjunction with this revision, the Trust was segregated into a Qualified Trust Fund and a Nonqualified Trust Fund. The Qualified Trust Fund is a nuclear decommissioning reserve fund, as defined in Section 468A, and is administered under that section of the IRC. As approved by the IRS, the Qualified Trust Fund elected to be taxed under the provisions of Section 468A, effective for tax years (calendar years) ending after July 18, 1984. Qualifying contributions are deductible when paid by the Company and are limited to the amount approved by the IRS. The Nonqualified Trust Fund is not subject to Section 468A and is administered in accordance with the indenture provisions. &lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Components of the Decommissioning Trust are set forth in the following table:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: 18pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left: 18pt; border-collapse: collapse"&gt; 				&lt;tr&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="2" style="width: 166.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;December 31,&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 24.5pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 61pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(Dollars in Thousands)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Investments, at fair value&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;132,802&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 85.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;133,723&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Accounts receivable from operations&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;73&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 85.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;470&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Other current liabilities&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;(779)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 85.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(702)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Other deferred credits&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;(4,710)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 85.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(4,200)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 13.5pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Net deferred tax liabilities&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;(1,100)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 85.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(347)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 13.5pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 270pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Accounts payable - intercompany&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;(64)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 85.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#16