0;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;122,298&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 85.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 13.5pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;123,283&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 10.5pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Investments&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Trust funds were invested in taxable fixed income securities, tax-exempt securities, domestic equity and international equity securities. The Qualified Trust Fund and Nonqualified Trust Fund investments are subject to indenture provisions and the Yankee Decommissioning Trust Statement of Investment Policy and Objectives.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 10.5pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Investment Income and Administrative Expenses&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Investment income is reinvested for the benefit of the Trust and is used to pay the trustee and investment management expenses of administering the Trust or to pay income taxes with respect to income or assets of the Trust.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="width: 36pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 28.5pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Unrealized Appreciation (Depreciation) of Investments&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Trust investments are stated at fair value and, accordingly, the Trust recognizes the unrealized appreciation (depreciation) of these investments. The total decommissioning trust cost basis was $103.0 million and $103.3 million as of December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. The fair value was $129.0 million and $130.5 million as of December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;The maturity schedules for fixed income securities held in the decommissioning trust at December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;31, 2025 and 2024 are as follows:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width: 490.5pt; margin-left: 6pt; border-collapse: collapse"&gt; 				&lt;tr&gt; 					&lt;td style="vertical-align: top"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="2" style="width: 55.5pt; padding-right: 6pt; padding-left: 6pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Over&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;But Not Over&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 46.5pt; padding-right: 6pt; padding-left: 6pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;0 -&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;1 Year&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 46.5pt; padding-right: 6pt; padding-left: 6pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;1 Year -&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;5 Years&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 49.5pt; padding-right: 6pt; padding-left: 6pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;5 Years -&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;10 Years&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 43.5pt; padding-right: 6pt; padding-left: 6pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;10 Years -&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;15 Years&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 46.5pt; padding-right: 6pt; padding-left: 6pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: